07:31.156 --> 07:33.810
So this is where git stash comes in.

07:33.810 --> 07:34.770
If I don't want to commit,

07:34.770 --> 07:36.990
I'm not ready to make a commit, it's unnecessary,

07:36.990 --> 07:41.370
I can use git stash to sort of pause, to save my changes

07:41.370 --> 07:43.050
without actually committing them.

07:43.050 --> 07:44.640
So that's what we're gonna learn how to do

07:44.640 --> 07:45.753
